        ],
        "test262Paths": [
          "test/built-ins/Reflect/get/return-value.js",
          "test/built-ins/Reflect/get/return-value-from-receiver.js"
        ],
        "notes": "Implements OrdinaryGet including prototype-chain lookup and the optional receiver argument, so accessor getters are invoked with the receiver as their this value. Getters that are undefined return undefined. PortNext100ExecutionTests covers ordinary and symbol property keys plus non-object-target rejection. Abrupt completions from property-key coercion are not yet covered."
      },
      {
        "clause": "28.1.6",
